     level 2 by defining ___F_O_R_T_I_F_Y___S_O_U_R_C_E to 1 or 2 before including any
     FreeBSD headers.  FreeBSD world builds can set _F_O_R_T_I_F_Y___S_O_U_R_C_E to provide
     a default value for ___F_O_R_T_I_F_Y___S_O_U_R_C_E.  When enabled, “FORTIFY_SOURCE” en‐
     ables extra bounds checking in various functions that accept buffers to
     be written into.  These functions currently have extra bounds checking
